  "citation": "Steele L P; Krummel P B; Langenfelds R L (2003): CSIRO GASLAB Network: Individual Flask Measurements of Atmospheric Trace Gases (April 2003). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (USA). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.DB1021",
